"A short, stout metalworking chisel made of bronze.  It's used in some "
"metalworking fabrication recipes.  Bronze chisels spark less than their steel"
" counterparts, but are less durable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crucible"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A small metalworking crucible.  Looks like a stout drink tumbler.  It's used "
"in some metalworking fabrication recipes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "clay crucible"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"A primitive metalworking crucible made of clay.  Looks like a stout drink "
"tumbler.  You could use it for metalworking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "electric forge"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
"An electric metalworking forge, powered by your electric grid.  With the "
"right tools, you could use this for metalworking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sheet"
#. ~ Description of "mild steel chainmail sheet"
#: data/json/items/tool/metalworking.json
msgid ""
